{"id":"5f74371081322951","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-predicative-bound.md","title":"Predicative Bound Theorem","display":"thm-predicative-bound — Predicative Bound Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-predicative-bound","aliases":["72-thm-predicative-bound"],"display":"thm-predicative-bound — Predicative Bound Theorem","depends_on":["[[72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure]]","[[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity, Springer, copyright 2009 (local catalog 2008)","source_location":"Buss Ch.IV print267–268/PDF279–280 sketch; Pohlers Cor8.4.4 print137/PDF147 and Thm8.5.31 print155/PDF165","verification_status":"source-and-signature-reviewed","proof_status":"source-proof-reviewed; independent-full-proof-not-reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-predicative-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-predicative-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-predicative-bound — Predicative Bound Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3aa8b43b760f7cdb\" href=\"?note=3aa8b43b760f7cdb\" title=\"72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure\">72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d09902009c3b686f\" href=\"?note=d09902009c3b686f\" title=\"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity, Springer, copyright 2009 (local catalog 2008)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Buss Ch.IV print267–268/PDF279–280 sketch; Pohlers Cor8.4.4 print137/PDF147 and Thm8.5.31 print155/PDF165"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-signature-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-proof-reviewed; independent-full-proof-not-reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)\\subseteq\\omega_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)\\subseteq\\omega_1\\)</span>是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3aa8b43b760f7cdb\" href=\"?note=3aa8b43b760f7cdb\" title=\"72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure\">72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure</a>的自治闭包；它使用Pohlers的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\mathsf L_{\\omega_1}\\)</span>公式与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\xi}\">\\(\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\xi}\\)</span>，不是任意给定理论族的序数界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span>为<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d09902009c3b686f\" href=\"?note=d09902009c3b686f\" title=\"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a>的首个正Veblen对角不动点。序数按von Neumann集合解释，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\beta\\in\\Gamma_0\\)</span>等价于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)=\\Gamma_0,\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)\\ (\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0),\\qquad\\sup\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)=\\Gamma_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)=\\Gamma_0,\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)\\ (\\beta&lt;\\Gamma_0),\\qquad\\sup\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)=\\Gamma_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Pohlers原书Cor8.4.4给Aut(ω)⊆Γ0；其上界来自8.4.1的自治闭包到Δ*闭包的包含、8.4.2中强临界数的Δ闭性，以及7.3.14的Veblen消切界与6.7.2的有界性定理。Lemma8.5.30证明Γ0⊆Aut(ω)：用自治闭包的向下闭合和序列ζn的共尾性，逐步由超限归纳证明进入下一Veblen闭包；Thm8.5.31合并两方向给精确等式。后两个断言由等式和Γ0为非零极限序数立即推出。源书对下界的类项、跳跃和归纳证明位于§8.5，已核对来源结论及证明依赖结构，但该长证明尚未在本注记逐引理独立重建，所以保留eligible_as_verified_dependency=false。本次恢复真正自治闭包结论，删除了仅Veblen有限项闭包的替代定理，也没有把待证的Γ0界藏入Hypothesis。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"3aa8b43b760f7cdb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"d09902009c3b686f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"3aa8b43b760f7cdb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)\\subseteq\\omega_1$是[[72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure]]的自治闭包；它使用Pohlers的$\\mathsf L_{\\omega_1}$公式与$\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\xi}$，不是任意给定理论族的序数界。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"d09902009c3b686f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma_0$为[[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]的首个正Veblen对角不动点。序数按von Neumann集合解释，$\\beta\\in\\Gamma_0$等价于$\\beta<\\Gamma_0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)\\subseteq\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L_{\\omega_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\xi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta<\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)=\\Gamma_0,\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)\\ (\\beta<\\Gamma_0),\\qquad\\sup\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)=\\Gamma_0.","display":true}],"bytes":2190,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-predicative-bound|thm-predicative-bound — Predicative Bound Theorem]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-285","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-predicative-bound — Predicative Bound Theorem](72-thm-predicative-bound.md)"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-predicative-bound]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-predicative-bound|thm-predicative-bound — Predicative Bound Theorem]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-predicative-bound]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-527","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-predicative-bound]]"}],"outgoing":["3aa8b43b760f7cdb","d09902009c3b686f"]}